# Ops loop

You are working in a git-tracked Obsidian vault at `ops/`.

- Start from `ops/HOME.md` and `ops/BOARD.md` (regenerate with `python3 ops/scripts/board_sync.py`).
- Roles: planner writes `ops/plans/`. Implementer opens a PR. Reviewer comments only — never merge.
- One ticket per session. Prefix `WF-` = this workflow. `PRD-` = product (none until we say so).
- No Jenkins. No prod writes. No secrets in notes.
- Full loop: `ops/workflow/LOOP.md`. Safety: `ops/workflow/SAFETY.md`.
